title: "CTIP — Cannabis Trichome Intelligence Platform"
abstract: >-
  Open-source microscopy computer vision platform for cannabis trichome detection, instance segmentation,
  morphology, optical maturity assessment and size measurement, with human-in-the-loop annotation and active learning.
